          {
            "title": "Example: Comma",
            "id": 116112,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Wähle das richtige Zeichen, um die beiden Parameter zu trennen.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"addPrefix\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"prefix, word\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" prefix + word;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" newWord = addPrefix(\" /><text value=\"&quot;re&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;do&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(newWord);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"25\" endIndex=\"26\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\":\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\";\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\".\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"/\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"redo\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>,</code> aus.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Order",
            "id": 116117,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Wie übergeben wir Werte an eine Funktion mit mehreren Parametern?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Die Werte und die Parameter müssen in der gleichen Reihenfolge sein</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Wir können die Werte in beliebiger Reihenfolge übergeben</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Die Werte und die Parameter müssen in umgekehrter Reihenfolge sein</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Die Werte und die Parameter müssen in der gleichen Reihenfolge sein.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Eine Funktion wird mit <code>first</code>, <code>second</code> und dann <code>third</code> deklariert. Wie müssen Werte beim Aufruf übergeben werden?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">In derselben Reihenfolge wie die Parameter</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">In beliebiger Reihenfolge, weil die Parameternamen übereinstimmen</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">In umgekehrter Reihenfolge</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">Indem jeder Wert einem Parameternamen zugeordnet wird</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">In derselben Reihenfolge wie die Parameter.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Order",
            "id": 116113,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Wähle die richtigen Werte, damit <code>\"Helene\"</code> als Zweites und <code>\"Joe\"</code> als Letztes angezeigt wird.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"showWinners\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"first, second, third\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;1st: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + first);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;2nd: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + second);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;3rd: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + third);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"showWinners(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Elaine&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Helene&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Joe&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"163\" endIndex=\"171\" /><option startIndex=\"171\" endIndex=\"172\" /><option startIndex=\"173\" endIndex=\"178\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;Mike&quot;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;Elaine&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"1st: Elaine\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"2nd: Helen\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"3rd: Joe\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>\"Helene\"</code>, gefolgt von <code>,</code> und schließlich <code>\"Joe\"</code> aus.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Vervollständige die Parameter, damit der Aufruf <code>Helene</code> als Zweites und <code>Joe</code> als Drittes anzeigt.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"showWinners\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"first, second, third\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;1st: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + first);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;2nd: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + second);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;3rd: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + third);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"showWinners(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Elaine&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Helene&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Joe&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"21\" endIndex=\"26\" /><option startIndex=\"28\" endIndex=\"34\" /><option startIndex=\"36\" endIndex=\"41\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"winner\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;Helene&quot;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;Joe&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"1st: Elaine\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"2nd: Helene\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"3rd: Joe\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>first</code>, gefolgt von <code>second</code> und schließlich <code>third</code> aus.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Multiple parameters",
            "id": 116119,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Was zeigt dieser Code in der Konsole an?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"sumUp\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"first, second, third\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" first + second + third;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" result = sumUp(\" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"20\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(result);\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"123\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">123</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">100203</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">100+20+3</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle 123 aus.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Der Aufruf übergibt drei Zahlen an <code>sumUp</code>. Welcher Wert wird zurückgegeben und dann ausgegeben?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"sumUp\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"first, second, third\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" first + second + third;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" result = sumUp(\" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"20\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(result);\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"123\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>123</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>100203</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>100 + 20 + 3</code></item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\"><code>3</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>123</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Parameters",
            "id": 116111,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Wähle den richtigen zweiten Parameter für diese Funktion.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"getAge\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"currentYear, yearOfBirth\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" currentYear - yearOfBirth;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" age = getAge(\" /><text value=\"2022\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"1998\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(age);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"29\" endIndex=\"40\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"1998\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;1998&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"24\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>yearOfBirth</code> aus.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Die Funktion zieht ein Geburtsjahr vom aktuellen Jahr ab. Benenne den zweiten Parameter, sodass der Aufruf das Alter <code>24</code> ergibt.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"getAge\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"currentYear, yearOfBirth\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" currentYear - yearOfBirth;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" age = getAge(\" /><text value=\"2022\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"1998\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(age);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"29\" endIndex=\"40\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"currentYear\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"age\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;1998&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"24\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>yearOfBirth</code> aus.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Naming Functions",
            "id": 116417,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Welche der folgenden Aussagen ist wahr, wenn es um die Benennung einer Funktion geht?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Funktionsnamen sollten klar sein und beschreiben, was die Funktion macht</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Wir können einer Funktion einen beliebigen Namen geben</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Es ist besser, einen langen und komplexen Namen für eine Funktion zu haben</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Funktionsnamen sollten klar sein und beschreiben, was die Funktion macht.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Du siehst eine Funktion namens <code>displayNumberOfNames</code>. Warum ist das ein besserer Name als ein vager Name wie <code>run</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Er beschreibt klar, was die Funktion tut.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Er sagt dir, wie viele Namen sich derzeit im Array befinden.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Seine Länge macht ihn klarer, unabhängig von der Bedeutung der Wörter.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Er beschreibt klar, was die Funktion tut.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "array.length",
            "id": 116469,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Welchen Wert zeigt der folgende Code an?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"displayNumberOfNames\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"names\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(names.length);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" students = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Laurel&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Yanni&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"displayNumberOfNames(students);\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"2\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>2</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>1</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>0</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>2</code> aus.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Stell dir vor, du fügst vor dem Funktionsaufruf <code>\"Ada\"</code> zu <code>students</code> hinzu. Was würde er ausgeben?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"displayNumberOfNames\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"names\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(names.length);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" students = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Laurel&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Yanni&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"displayNumberOfNames(students);\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"2\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>3</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>2</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>1</code></item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\"><code>0</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>3</code> aus.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Processed Values",
            "id": 116473,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Was zeigt der folgende Code an?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" array = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Leia&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Jon&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Patricia&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Isaac&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"processValues\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"arr\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(arr[\" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"] + \" /><text value=\"&quot; and &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + arr[\" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"] +\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&quot; are the last two student names in reverse order.&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"processValues(array);\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Isaac and Patricia are the last two student names in reverse order.\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>Isaac und Patricia sind die letzten beiden Schülernamen in umgekehrter Reihenfolge</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>Jon und Leia sind die letzten beiden Schülernamen in umgekehrter Reihenfolge</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>Patricia and Isaac are the last two student names in reverse order</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>Isaac und Patricia sind die letzten beiden Schülernamen in umgekehrter Reihenfolge</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Die Funktion liest <code>arr[3]</code> vor <code>arr[2]</code>. Welche beiden Namen erscheinen in ihrer Nachricht?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" array = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Leia&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Jon&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Patricia&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Isaac&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"processValues\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"arr\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(arr[\" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"] + \" /><text value=\"&quot; and &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + arr[\" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"] +\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&quot; are the last two student names in reverse order.&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"processValues(array);\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Isaac and Patricia are the last two student names in reverse order.\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>Isaac</code> und <code>Patricia</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>Jon</code> und <code>Leia</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>Patricia</code> und <code>Isaac</code></item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\"><code>Isaac</code> und <code>Jon</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>Isaac</code> und <code>Patricia</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Verb/Prefix",
            "id": 116474,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Wähle den Funktionsnamen, der am besten zu der unten stehenden Funktion passt, die den Benutzernamen des Kunden anzeigt.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"displayUserInfo\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"info\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Name: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + info[\" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"] + \" /><text value=\"&quot;, &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + \" /><text value=\"&quot;ID: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + info[\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" user = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Megan&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"2837434\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"displayUserInfo(user);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"128\" endIndex=\"149\" /><option startIndex=\"9\" endIndex=\"30\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"display()\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"display(user)\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Name: Megan, ID: 2837434\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>displayUserInfo(info)</code>, gefolgt von <code>displayUserInfo(user)</code> aus.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Vervollständige Definition und Aufruf, damit die Funktion das deklarierte <code>user</code>-Array erhält und dessen Namen und ID anzeigt.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"displayUserInfo\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"info\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Name: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + info[\" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"] + \" /><text value=\"&quot;, &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + \" /><text value=\"&quot;ID: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + info[\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" user = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Megan&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"2837434\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"displayUserInfo(user);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"128\" endIndex=\"149\" /><option startIndex=\"9\" endIndex=\"30\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"displayUserInfo()\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"displayUserInfo(&quot;user&quot;)\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"displayUserInfo(info[0])\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Name: Megan, ID: 2837434\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>displayUserInfo(info)</code>, gefolgt von <code>displayUserInfo(user)</code> aus.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Passing Correct Input",
            "id": 116475,
